{
  "_doc": "GBR news_light3_4: news18 未测字段轴 × 相关性矩几何。壳与 news_light3_1/2/3 逐字一致（group_neutralize(densify(market)) + ts_target_tvr_decay 0.05）。W12 用 group_zscore 分组轴几何（点塔帖原壳）。",
  "settings": {"region": "GBR", "universe": "TOP700", "delay": 1, "neutralization": "FAST", "decay": 15, "truncation": 0.05, "maxTrade": "OFF", "nanHandling": "ON", "pasteurization": "ON", "unitHandling": "VERIFY", "language": "FASTEXPR"},
  "W1": "ts_target_tvr_decay(group_neutralize(ts_corr(vec_avg(sentiment_news_impact_projection_d1), returns, 22), densify(market)), target_tvr=0.05, lambda_max=5, lambda_min=0)",
